{"type":"message","id":"64383eae","parentId":"eb26fb97","timestamp":"2026-08-02T01:00:00.243Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:rules-refresh-daily Cursor协作规则刷新] 【每日规则刷新】请记住以下 Cursor 协作规则（每天提醒一次）：\n\n1. 当用户要求让 Cursor 做某件事时，必须执行：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --title \"任务标题\" --instructions \"具体指令\" --submitted-by \"OpenClaw\" --notify\n\n2. 当用户回复了 Cursor 发来的飞书确认消息时，必须执行：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\confirm_write.py\" --task-id \"task_id\" --decision auto --reply \"用户回复原文\"\n\n3. 查看当前 Cursor 任务队列：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --list\n\n4. 查看已完成任务结果：\npython \"C:\\ADHD_agent\\.cursor\\skills\\async-notify\\scripts\\submit_task.py\" --results\n\n以上规则已写入 AGENTS.md，请确认记住。无需回复，静默确认即可。\nCurrent time: Sunday, August 2nd, 2026 — 09:00 (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-08-02 01:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1785632400241}}
{"type":"message","id":"47707630","parentId":"64383eae","timestamp":"2026-08-02T01:00:05.928Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a cron job notification reminding me of the Cursor collaboration rules. The instruction says \"无需回复，静默确认即可\" (no need to reply, just silently confirm). So I should just return a brief acknowledgment.\n\nActually, looking at the cron delivery format - it says \"Return your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically.\" But this is a system event, not a task that needs a response to someone. The instruction says to silently confirm.\n\nLet me just acknowledge I've received and noted the rules refresh."},{"type":"text","text":"已收到每日规则刷新通知。Cursor 协作规则已确认：\n\n1. ✅ 任务提交：`submit_task.py --title --instructions --submitted-by \"OpenClaw\" --notify`\n2. ✅ 确认回复：`confirm_write.py --task-id --decision auto --reply`\n3. ✅ 查看队列：`--list`\n4. ✅ 查看结果：`--results`\n\n静默确认完毕。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1785632400242}}
